# Title: Tales of Hearts R
# ID: PCSE00429
# Edit the value on any line marked "<-- EDIT" (here or in VitaCheat), then activate the cheat.
#
# DIFFICULTY MULTIPLIERS (the game's own table): one cheat per stat, one line per difficulty.
#   Multipliers are 32-bit floats: 0.5=3F000000 0.75=3F400000 0.8=3F4CCCCD 1.0=3F800000
#   1.1=3F8CCCCD 1.2=3F99999A 1.5=3FC00000 2.0=40000000 2.5=40200000 3.0=40400000
#   4.0=40800000 5.0=40A00000 10.0=41200000
#   Level bonus = whole levels added to every enemy (hex, 16-bit: 000A = 10, 0014 = 20, 0028 = 40).
#   All values below are the game's defaults.
#
# GUARD COUNTER WARNING VOLUME: the sound of an enemy glowing red is played louder.
#   Edit the last two digits of the marked line: 01 normal, 02 2x (default), 04 4x, 08 8x, 10 16x.
#   The game caps a sound at twice its full volume: at the maximum SE volume setting, 4x+ sounds like 2x.

